# Ablation of the absolute-action recipe of the reported comparisons (configs/reported/ours_absolute.args) without
# per-sample clipping of the action cotangent: neither in the window's backward nor on the action targets, whose step
# is then set from the unclipped gradients. 1.5 h of training as reported. Written out in full (a configuration file
# cannot remove an included option); otherwise as configs/base/ours.args.
--seed 0 --clips all --num-envs 4096 --horizon 64 --solver-iterations 10 --no-remat
--reset-sampling supermimic --uniform-over bins
--replay-steps 1000 --collect-envs 4096 --collect-noise 0.1 --utd 0.4
--mask-after-done --critic-pre-state --term-penalty 2 0.08 0.10
--act-noise 0.05
--action-target 8 1 0.03 --action-target-lr 6e-4 --action-target-delta-floor 0.3
--anchor-to-decoder --enc-hoist on
--lr 2e-4 --iters 400000 --lr-warmup-steps 500 --lr-decay-to 0.1 --lr-decay-steps 16000
--ckpt-every 250
--physics engine
--hours 1.5
